  "aiContextParagraph": "Budi Arie underwent a lengthy interrogation by Bareskrim Polri investigators as part of an ongoing probe into alleged treason. The investigation reportedly centers on activities linked to former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo and several other suspects. Following the nine-hour session, Budi Arie denied any connection to the alleged criminal acts, clarifying that his past statements concerning the potential acceleration of the 2029 election and his historical video analysis did not constitute a plot against the state. While he acknowledged knowing Listyo Sigit Prabowo, he maintained he had no familiarity with the other individuals named in the case. The interrogation, which involved 42 specific questions, has drawn public reaction, with some political figures commenting on the nature of the investigation and the previous rhetoric used by Budi Arie regarding legal authority.",
